tp://scp-int.wikidot.com/consilium-fulminis">Storm's Proposal</a></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/a-sunny-day-at-the-clockwork-gallery">SunnyClockwork</a> &#8212; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/sunny-s-black-and-white-art">SunnyClockwork's Artwork Hub</a></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/swaghetti-s-arthur-page">Swaghetti</a> &#8212; <a href="http://scpwiki.com/scp-4693">SCP-4693: !!WATCH FLIPPIN' FIT FOREIGN CHICKS ENTERTAIN YOU LIVE!!</a></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/caterer-tim-tanhony-hyne-s-personnel-file">Tanhony</a> &#8212; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4317">SCP-4317: Catscratch</a></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/dr-taylor-itkin-s-personnel-file">taylor_itkin</a> &#8212; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/seminars-hub">Seminars and Workshops Hub</a></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-deadly-moose-personnel-file">thedeadlymoose</a> &#8212; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/yesterday">Yesterday</a></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/themanhattenprojects-author-page">TheManhattenProject</a> &#8212; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/been-a-while-crocodile">Been A While, Crocodile</a></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/themightymcb-s-author-page">TheMightlyMcB</a> &#8212; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5153">SCP-5153: The Meteor Who Cried Wolf</a></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/t-rutherford-author-page">T Rutherford</a> &#8212; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4978">SCP-4978: BROOK TOWN BEAT DOWN</a></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/tufto-personnel-file">Tufto</a> &#8212; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/little-pleasures">Little Pleasures</a></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/uncle-nicolini-author-page">Uncle Nicolini</a> &#8212; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/clef-goes-to-the-dmv">Clef Goes To The DMV</a></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/uraniumempire">UraniumEmpire</a> &#8212; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/ambrose-backdoor-soho">Ambrose Backdoor Soho</a></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/weizhong">weizhong</a> &#8212; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/mission-accomplished">Mission Accomplished</a></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/weryllium">weryllium</a> &#8212; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4394">SCP-4394: Liquid Piano</a></p> <p>WhiteGuard &#8212; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/meet-the-administrators-hub">Meet the Administrators Hub</a></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/yossipossi-authorphage">Yossipossi</a> &#8212; <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-5545">SCP-5545: 𝙰 𝙱 𝙽 𝙾 𝚁 𝙼 𝙰 𝙻 𝙸 𝚃 𝚈</a></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/researcher-zyn-s-personnel-file">Zyn</a> &#8212; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3338">SCP-3338: Otamatone wants to be your roommate~</a></p> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-6" style="display:none"> <p><strong>My Artwork:</strong> My art can be used in any article, provided that I am credited in an author post or something similar.</p> <p><strong>Rewrites/Ownership:</strong> If I've been inactive for at least six months and cannot be contacted, then <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karakatt" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5950867&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606939552" alt="KaraKatt" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5950867)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karakatt" >KaraKatt</a></span> has authority over my articles, unless/until I return from hiatus. Coauthored articles are an exception, and ownership is transferred to their respective coauthors.</p> <p><strong>Use of Original Work:</strong> Any of my articles, characters, or other on-site work can be referenced in articles or used in merchandise, as long as they are properly attributed. However, I strongly request that they are not used or applied in any NSFW work or other context.</p> <p><strong>Reclaiming Authorship:</strong> You guys all know what I look like (if you need a reminder, my face is in the first tab). I can confirm my identity if needed, and various users have enough of my personal information that they can further confirm my legitimacy.</p> <p><strong>Emergency Contacts:</strong> If I am desperately needed and cannot be reached over IRC or Wikidot, a bunch of folks have my Discord information, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karakatt" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5950867&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606939552" alt="KaraKatt" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5950867)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karakatt" >KaraKatt</a></span> has my phone number; they can reach out to me for you.</p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-7" style="display:none"> <p>This tab is just for anything else that I need to keep track of or whatever.</p> <hr /> <p>Keeping an eye on these:</p> <hr /> <p>My to-do list:</p> <ul> <li><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Write recommended authors/articles list.</span></li> <li>Add more author commentaries.</li> <li><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">FINISH THE 507 LOG YOU IDIOT.</span> YES!</li> <li>Ask the Rewrite team if you can do something with the old Decommissioned SCPs.</li> <li><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Fix the redactions on 194.</span></li> </ul> <hr /> <p><a href="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/calibri-bold-s-seminars-sandbox">Seminars Sandbox</a></p> <p><a href="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/calibri-bold-s-mast-sandbox">MAST Sandbox</a></p> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5045819&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606939552" alt="Calibri Bold" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5045819)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" >Calibri Bold</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-726971-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. Not a tale or anything, mind you.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-726971-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. Long story. Actually, not really. I thought of it and it was weird.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-726971-3"><a href="javascript:;" >3</a>. Or sub-department, depending on your headcanon.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-726971-4"><a href="javascript:;" >4</a>. I'm not gonna spoil it, you have to read it yourself.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-726971-5"><a href="javascript:;" >5</a>. While I was around for the SCP-5000 Contest, real life issues at the time meant I was unable to participate.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-726971-6"><a href="javascript:;" >6</a>. I'm not counting this author page because a) it's ever-growing, and b) it's technically two author pages smushed together.</div> </div> 
