&lt;td&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://ja.scp-wiki.net/indonootoko-s-proposal&quot;&gt;Indonootoko&#039;s Proposal (JP)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-jp.wikidot.com/indonootoko-s-proposal-iii&quot;&gt;Indonootoko&#039;s Proposal III (JP)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
