						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <p>&lt;begin log 2:03 am&gt;</p> <p><strong>MTF-336:</strong> Man, garfield duty is boring&#8230;</p> <p><strong>MTF-██:</strong> Yeah it is. Hey, what's that sound?</p> <p>Screech is heard on log then something shattering</p> <p><strong>MTF-██:</strong> HOT ███ IT BROKE RIGHT THROUGH THE WA-</p> <p>Crunches heard on log</p> <p><strong>MTF-336:</strong> OH ███ IT GOT DAN! REQUESTING BACKUP!</p> <p>radio static heard</p> <p><strong>MTF-██:</strong> On it, what breached?</p> <p><strong>MTF-336:</strong> THE MOTHER███ING GARFIELD!</p> <p><strong>MTF-██:</strong> Oh you're kidding me&#8230; I need a RRT squadron. Garf- [inaudible] -peat Garfield is breached.</p> <p><strong>MTF-██:</strong> 336, switch to channel 3</p> <p><strong>MTF-336:</strong> Copy</p> <p><strong>Will:</strong> This is researcher will, does anybody copy?</p> <p><strong>MTF-336:</strong> I copy, what is it?</p> <p><strong>Will:</strong> Oh ██ its right there&#8230; Help me please its almost here.</p> <p><strong>MTF-336:</strong> Maintain your position. We have a squadron coming.</p> <p>Weird liquid sounds are heard</p> <p><strong>RRT-██:</strong> We layed down the lasagna. Maintaining posi- MOTHER OF ███ THAT THING IS FAST!</p> <p><strong>RRT-██:</strong> RUN!</p> <p><strong>MTF-336:</strong> Drop lasagna into its cage!</p> <p><strong>RRT-███</strong> I got some in! Door controls stand by!</p> <p><strong>Researcher rick:</strong> Standing by. Yes! It took the bait! Closing doors now.</p> <p><strong>MTF-336:</strong> Hey will, you can come out now.</p> <p>5 seconds pass</p> <p><strong>MTF-336:</strong> Will?</p> <p>&lt;end of log 2:46 am&gt;<br /> [[/tab]]<br /> [[tab SCP-008 (infection)]]<br /> &lt;begin log 4:23 am&gt;</p> <p><strong>RRT-██:</strong> Alright guys, the person who breached this thing may be listening. We will refer to ourselves as our code names now, remember im alpha A3. Got it?</p> <p><strong>Charlie-A1:</strong> Yes sir!</p> <p><strong>Charlie-A2:</strong> Yes sir!</p> <p><strong>Bravo-A1:</strong> Yes sir!</p> <p><strong>Bravo-A2:</strong> Yes sir!</p> <p><strong>Alpha-A1:</strong> Yes sir!</p> <p>5 seconds pass</p> <p><strong>Alpha-A3:</strong> Alpha-A2, I said do you understand?</p> <p>10 Seconds pass</p> <p><strong>Alpha-A3:</strong> Alpha-A2?</p> <p>Everyone is quiet for 1 minute</p> <p>Suddenly faint screams are heard on Alpha-A2's end</p> <p><strong>Alpha-A3:</strong> Alpha-A2? Do you copy?</p> <p>Heavy breathing is heard on the log. Its getting louder.</p> <p>Gunshots are heard on log</p> <p><strong>Alpha-A2:</strong> Phew&#8230; I got those ███'s.</p> <p><strong>Alpha-A1:</strong> A2? What just happened?</p> <p><strong>Alpha-A2:</strong> Oh ███ man&#8230; There were these, these things&#8230; They were so distorted and- oh gosh&#8230;</p> <p><strong>Alpha-A1:</strong> Where are you? You must be close since you're in our team.</p> <p><strong>Alpha-A2:</strong> Lemme see if there's any signs&#8230; I'm by wing 3&#8230; In the researcher section&#8230;</p> <p><strong>Charlie-A2:</strong> Researcher section in wing 3? Hey man&#8230; Isn't that like ground zero?</p> <p><strong>Alpha-A2:</strong> Wait&#8230; what?</p> <p><strong>Bravo-A1:</strong> That means GET THE ███ OUT OF THERE NOW!</p> <p><strong>Alpha-A2:</strong> I'm headed into the CDC! Its the closest place!</p> <p><strong>Charlie-A1:</strong> That doesn't seem like the wisest decision&#8230;</p> <p><strong>Alpha-A2:</strong> Wait&#8230; Did I literally just say the CDC? Oh ███ thats a horde&#8230;</p> <p>Running is heard on log</p> <p><strong>Alpha-A2:</strong> THATS A LOT! THAT IS A LOT OF EM!</p> <p>Gunshots are heard</p> <p><strong>Alpha-A2:</strong> THEYRE JUST GETTING BACK UP!</p> <p><strong>Alpha-A1:</strong> Oh my gosh man&#8230; Its common sense. Aim for the ███ing head, or aim for the legs. It'll either kill em, or disable em.</p> <p><strong>Alpha-A1:</strong> Wait, I see one&#8230;</p> <p><strong>Alpha-A3:</strong> I see it too&#8230; Its just one though. Fire at will</p> <p>Gunshots are heard</p> <p><strong>Alpha-A1:</strong> Hah easy, let's go check out the body.</p> <p><strong>Alpha-A3:</strong> Are you that stu-</p> <p><strong>Alpha-A1:</strong> GAAAUGH MY LEGS! AAUUGHHH! AAAAUuuaaughuhhh&#8230;</p> <p><strong>Alpha-A3:</strong> OH MY ███!</p> <p>Screaming and gunshots heard</p> <p>5 seconds pass</p> <p><strong>Bravo-A1:</strong> Alpha-A1 and A3? Do you copy?</p> <p><strong>Bravo-A2:</strong> ███ IT! THAT WAS MY BROTHER!</p> <p><strong>Bravo-A1:</strong> Oh gosh I'm so sorry dude&#8230; Hey do you hear something?</p> <p><strong>Bravo-A1:</strong> Is that Alpha-A2?</p> <p><strong>Alpha-A2:</strong> THERES A HORDE! GET OUT!</p> <p><strong>Charlie-A2:</strong> A horde?</p> <p><strong>Bravo-A1:</strong> YES ITS A HORDE! GET OUT OF THERE CHAR-</p> <p>Static is heard</p> <p>10 seconds pass</p> <p><strong>Charlie-A1:</strong> Bravo? Team bravo? Do you copy?</p> <p><strong>Charlie-A2:</strong> A1, let's go. Were getting out.</p> <p><strong>Charlie-A1:</strong> O- ok&#8230;</p> <p>Five minutes pass</p> <p><strong>Charlie-A2:</strong> Wait&#8230; Is that a survivor?</p> <p><strong>???:</strong> *whispers* Shut the ███ up!</p> <p>Gun cocking is heard</p> <p><strong>Charlie-A1:</strong> Identify yourself</p> <p><strong>???:</strong> *Whispers* I said shut up! I'm MTF-336</p> <p><strong>Charlie-A2:</strong> *Whispers* I thought the Bravo team just died&#8230;</p> <p><strong>MTF-336:</strong> *whispers* I'm not the bravo team! I was recovering in the medbay after the Garfield incident, and an alarm goes off. Some people run in, and barricade the doors. Theyre- they're all dead.</p> <p><strong>Charlie-A2:</strong> *Whispers* dang man. Wait.. Whats that?</p> <p>Shuffling heard on log</p> <p><strong>Charlie-A1:</strong> Oh no.. Oh nonono thats the bravo team AND the alpha team&#8230;</p> <p><strong>MTF-336:</strong> RUN!</p> <p>Gunshots are heard and screaming and running.</p> <p>&lt;DATA LOST&gt;</p> <p>&lt;End of log 5:16 am&gt;</p> <div class="footer-wikiwalk-nav"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>&#171; <a class="newpage" href="/">-----</a> | Zombie | <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/duccy-hub:darkest-days">Darkest days</a> &#187;</p> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/duccy-boi" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7059423&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606939555" alt="Duccy boi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7059423)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/duccy-boi" >Duccy boi</a></span></p> 
